{"title":"Generative Design","link":"https://kottke.org/25/09/generative-design","date":1758744003000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1216\" height=\"1216\" alt=\"a bunch of overlapping 'KOTTKE DOT ORG' phrases with a bright green background\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1216\" height=\"1216\" alt=\"concentric circles that resemble tree rings\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1216\" height=\"1216\" alt=\"the words 'KOTTKE DOT ORG' connected by lines\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-04.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-04.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-04.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1216\" height=\"1216\" alt=\"a spiral shape\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-05.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-05.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-05.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1216\" height=\"1216\" alt=\"the letters from 'KOTTKE DOT ORG' randomly placed around a rectangle\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-06.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-06.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/gen-design-06.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1216\" height=\"1216\" alt=\"many overlapping spirals\" /></p>\n\n<p>I had a lot of fun playing around with <a href=\"https://www.generativ.design/\">this collection of generative design tools</a>, especially the textual ones. I wore out the “randomize” button on each of these. (via <a href=\"https://sidebar.io\">sidebar</a>)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/design\">design</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/programming\">programming</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/09/generative-design\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"c13d569168ad41376fc3ad174e8dc86b6deec24e9e34d25e6d78c0cf75719d53","category":"Sites"}